  "worked_solution": "Multiplying each row in the first matrix by each column in the second, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AB & =[\\begin{aligned}-3 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 4\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}1 & -5 \\\\ 3 & 2\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-3\\cdot 1+2\\cdot 3 & -3\\cdot (-5)+2\\cdot 2 \\\\ 0\\cdot 1+4\\cdot 3 & 0\\cdot (-5)+4\\cdot 2\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-3+6 & 15+4 \\\\ 0+12 & 0+8\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}3 & 19 \\\\ 12 & 8\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$",
